# Positional references that predate the prohibition, one row per accounted
# position: shape, path and the token itself, tab-separated. The reference class
# of check-plan-convergence.sh compares the tracked tree against this record and
# reports every arrival; what is recorded here is absorbed and reported about
# nothing. A comment line and a blank line are ignored.
#
# A row is added by hand from the arrival finding, which prints the row that
# would account for it. Removing a row is what re-opens a position for
# reporting.
